#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Predstavljanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kppp; is a dialer and front end for <application>pppd</application>. It "
"allows for interactive script generation and network setup. It will automate "
"the dialing in process to your <acronym>ISP</acronym> while letting you "
"conveniently monitor the entire process."
msgstr ""
"&kppp; je birač i prednji kraj za <application>pppd</application>. On "
"omogućuje generiranje interaktivne skripte i podešavanje mreže. On će "
"automatizovati proces biranja u vašem <application>ISP</application> dok vam "
"omogućava da jednostavno pratite cijeli proces."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once connected &kppp; will provide a rich set of statistics and keep track "
"of the time spent online for you."
msgstr ""
"Jednom spojen &kppp; će pružiti bogat komplet statistika i pratiti za vas "
"provedeno online vrijeme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A built-in terminal and script generator will enable you to set up your "
"connection with ease. You will no longer need an additional terminal program "
"such as <application>seyon</application> or <application>minicom</"
"application> to test and setup your connection."
msgstr ""
"Ugrađeni terminal i generator skripte će vam omogućiti da s lahkoćom "
"podesite vezu. Vi više nećete trebati dodatni program terminala kao što je "
"<application>seyon</application> ili <application>minicom</application> za "
"testiranje i podešavanje vaše veze."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kppp; features elaborate phone cost accounting, which enables you to easily "
"track your online costs."
msgstr ""
"&kppp; podržava elaboriranje obračuna troškova telefona, koji vam omogućava "
"da lahko pratite vaše troškove online."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We hope you enjoy this dialer, and that it eases your way onto the internet."
msgstr ""
"Nadamo se da ćete uživati u ovom biraču, i da vam olakša put na internet."

