"However, nearly everything in &kppp; was rewritten so <application>ezppp</"
"application> and &kppp; do not have much in common any longer."
msgstr ""
"&kppp; je izveden iz <application>ezppp</application> 0.6, od Jay Painter. "
"Međutim, blizu sve u &kppp; je ponovo pisano pa <application>ezppp</"
"application> i &kppp; nemaju više puno zajedničkog."

