msgid "Preparing your Computer for a &PPP; Connection"
msgstr "Pripremanje vašeg računara za &PPP; Spajanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The following sections contain some fairly generic information for several "
"common operating systems which might run &kppp;. The following sites may be "
"of interest for further information about the <acronym>ppp</acronym> "
"protocol, <application>pppd</application> and networking in general:"
msgstr ""
"Sljedeće sekcije sadrže neke prilično generičke informacije za nekoliko "
"običnih operativnih sistema koji bi mogli pokrenuti &kppp;. Sljedeće "
"stranice mogu biti od interesa za dodatne informacije o <application>ppp</"
"application> protokolu, <application>pppd</application> i umrežavanju u "
"cjelini:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &Linux; &PPP; HOWTO: <ulink url=\"http://tldp.org/HOWTO/PPP-HOWTO/\"></"
"ulink>"
msgstr ""
"&Linux; &PPP; KAKODA: <ulink url=\"http://tldp.org/HOWTO/PPP-HOWTO/\"></"
"ulink>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Network Administrators' Guide: <ulink url=\"http://tldp.org/LDP/nag/nag."
"html\"></ulink>"
msgstr ""
"Vodič Mrežnih Administratora: <ulink url=\"http://tldp.org/LDP/nag/nag.html"
"\"></ulink>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid "Preparing a &Linux; system for &PPP;"
msgstr "Pripremanje &Linux; sistema za &PPP;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:204
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order for &kppp; (or indeed, <application>pppd</application>) to work, "
"your kernel must have ppp support compiled in. If this is not the case, get "
"yourself the latest version of <application>pppd</application> from any of "
"the popular &Linux; archives (such as <ulink url=\"ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/"
"Linux/system/network/serial/ppp/\"></ulink>, and recompile your kernel with "
"<acronym>ppp</acronym> support enabled."
msgstr ""
"Da bi &kppp; (ili stvarno, <application>pppd</application>) radio, vaš "
"kernel mora imati podršku prevođenja ppp. Ako to nije slučaj, nabavite "
"najnoviju verziju <application>pppd</application> iz bilo koje popularne "
"&Linux; arhive kao što je <ulink url=\"ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/"
"system/network/serial/ppp/\"></ulink>, i ponovo prevedite vaš kernel s "
"<acronym>ppp</acronym> podrškom omogućenom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Don't fret, since this sounds a lot scarier than it actually is. Don't "
"forget to install <application>pppd</application> afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Ne brinite se, jer ovo zvuči puno strašnije nego što jeste. Ne zaboravite da "
"instalirate <application>pppd</application> poslije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you're not sure if you have a kernel with ppp support, issue the "
"<command>dmesg</command> at the command prompt and look for something like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"Ako niste sigurni da imate kernel sa ppp podrškom, izdajte <command>dmesg</"
"command> na komandnoj liniji i tražiti nešto ovako:"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<computeroutput>\n"
"&PPP;: version 2.3.0 (demand dialing)\n"
"TCP compression code copyright 1989 Regents of the University of California\n"
"&PPP; Dynamic channel allocation code copyright 1995 Caldera, Inc.\n"
"&PPP; line discipline registered\n"
"</computeroutput>"
msgstr ""
"<computeroutput>\n"
"&PPP;: verzija 2.3.0 (zahtjeva biranje)\n"
"TCP kompresovanje koda autorska prava 1989 Regents of the University of "
"California\n"
"&PPP; Dinamičko kanalisanje raspodjele koda autorska prava 1995 Caldera, "
"Inc.\n"
"&PPP; registrovani režim linija\n"
"</computeroutput>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kppp; tries to find out for itself if your kernel supports &PPP;. If not, "
"you will be notified as soon as &kppp; starts up."
msgstr ""
"&kppp; pokušava saznati za sebe da li vaš kernel podržava &PPP;. Ako ne, "
"biti ćete obaviješteni čim &kppp; se pokrene."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:225
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For &Linux; 2.x kernels, the <application>pppd</application> daemon should "
"be version 2.3 or greater. You can find out what version your system has, by "
"issuing the command <userinput><command>pppd</command> <option>--version</"
"option></userinput> on the command line. None of the <application>pppd</"
"application> daemons actually have a <option>--version</option>, but putting "
"the option in will cause the <application>pppd</application> daemon to issue "
"an error message, and then to print out a list of options and other "
"information, which includes the version of the <application>ppd</"
"application> daemon."
msgstr ""
"Za &Linux; 2.x kernele, <application>pppd</application> daemon bi trebao "
"biti verzija 2.3 ili veća. Možete saznati koju verziju vaš sistem ima, "
"izdavanjem naredbe <userinput><command>pppd</command> <option>--verzija</"
"option></userinput> na komandnoj liniji. Nijedan od <application>pppd</"
"application> daemona ustvari ima <option>--verzija</option>, ali stavljanje "
"opcije će uzrokovati <application>pppd</application> daemon da izbaci poruku "
"o greški, a zatim isprintati popis opcija i drugih informacija, koje "
"uključuje verzija <application>ppd</application> daemon."
